<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1717034381"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:17.408"><div begin="15.459" end="43.882" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.459" end="20.967" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.459" end="16.610">十二点</span><span begin="16.610" end="17.136">半</span> <span begin="17.571" end="17.968">你</span><span begin="17.968" end="18.148">不</span><span begin="18.148" end="18.538">在</span><span begin="18.538" end="20.396">身边的回家路</span><span begin="20.396" end="20.967">上</span></p><p begin="21.404" end="28.148" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.404" end="21.793">一</span><span begin="21.793" end="22.046">个</span><span begin="22.046" end="22.405">人</span><span begin="22.405" end="23.321">走在城</span><span begin="23.321" end="24.408">市的夜</span><span begin="24.408" end="24.929">晚</span> <span begin="25.341" end="26.714">无人结伴</span> <span begin="26.714" end="27.302">多孤</span><span begin="27.302" end="28.148">单</span></p><p begin="31.005" end="36.621" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.005" end="32.200">雨滴漫</span><span begin="32.200" end="32.688">漫</span> <span begin="33.006" end="33.447">沾</span><span begin="33.447" end="33.711">湿</span><span begin="33.711" end="34.094">的</span><span begin="34.094" end="35.078">裙子曾</span><span begin="35.078" end="35.959">为你穿</span><span begin="35.959" end="36.621">上</span></p><p begin="36.935" end="43.882" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.935" end="37.418">今</span><span begin="37.418" end="37.655">夜</span><span begin="37.655" end="37.952">却</span><span begin="37.952" end="38.987">少了你</span><span begin="38.987" end="39.944">撑的雨</span><span begin="39.944" end="40.556">伞</span> <span begin="40.988" end="42.295">如何驱散</span> <span begin="42.295" end="42.957">这伤</span><span begin="42.957" end="43.882">感</span></p></div><div begin="46.688" end="1:00.987" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="46.688" end="49.463" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.688" end="47.725">Oh,</span> <span begin="47.725" end="48.062">I</span> <span begin="48.062" end="48.426">must</span> <span begin="48.426" end="49.463">confess</span></p><p begin="49.532" end="51.316" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.532" end="50.081">You</span> <span begin="50.081" end="50.400">made</span> <span begin="50.400" end="50.734">a</span> <span begin="50.734" end="51.316">mess</span></p><p begin="51.534" end="57.389" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.534" end="52.211">我的</span><span begin="52.211" end="52.662">世</span><span begin="52.662" end="53.366">界</span> <span begin="53.511" end="55.452">在你离开以后</span> <span begin="55.452" end="57.155">从此留下缺</span><span begin="57.155" end="57.389">口</span></p><p begin="57.390" end="1:00.987" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.390" end="58.392">不敢回</span><span begin="58.392" end="59.070">首</span> <span begin="59.709" end="1:00.080">You</span> <span begin="1:00.080" end="1:00.987">know</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.259" end="1:37.740" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:01.259" end="1:08.765" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.259" end="1:02.317">一月的</span><span begin="1:02.317" end="1:04.119">冷空</span><span begin="1:04.119" end="1:05.013">气</span> <span begin="1:05.214" end="1:06.281">总会让</span><span begin="1:06.281" end="1:08.092">我想</span><span begin="1:08.092" end="1:08.765">起</span></p><p begin="1:09.130" end="1:15.337" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.130" end="1:09.542">我</span><span begin="1:09.542" end="1:10.257">的手被</span><span begin="1:10.257" end="1:10.752">你握</span><span begin="1:10.752" end="1:11.585">紧</span> <span begin="1:12.856" end="1:13.328">偷</span><span begin="1:13.328" end="1:14.416">偷放进口</span><span begin="1:14.416" end="1:14.697">袋</span><span begin="1:14.697" end="1:15.337">里</span></p><p begin="1:16.727" end="1:24.367" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.727" end="1:17.872">四月花</span><span begin="1:17.872" end="1:19.803">开遍</sp